        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An assessment of a patient&apos;s performance status — their level of functioning in terms of self-care, daily activity and physical ability — graded on the Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG) scale (0–5).</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


